>>
Rule 1 (input must be a Tensor object)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must have a floating-point dtype; avoid 'Char'/int8)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 4 (disallow Char/int8 dtype to avoid "not implemented for 'Char'")
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1
>>
Rule 6 (reject all integer/uint8 dtypes via conditional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5) then false
